{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a5a7c60f1ffa8fbd84db9d5c747966e0945f03d04b80d440d0c282d3de64cd68", "ja": "花咲く乙女たち", "zh": "绽放的少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "733bf038f964cd2018d6e5e024eb9d33181c9b317be7d011c934506e5c4f3872", "ja": "本番当日。恋について、ほんの少し理解を\n深めたというウィルゴの3人。研究の成果を\n発揮し天体公演は大成功！　最高のステージ\nを作り上げるために頑張った3人の顔は、\n恋する乙女のようにキラキラ輝いていた。", "zh": "到了表演当天，『处女座』的三位成员\n在稍稍加深对爱情的理解后，发挥她们\n研究的成果，让天体公演圆满成功！\n她们三人奋力带来最棒的表演，而脸上\n表情就好似坠入爱河的少女般闪闪发光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3227d62c321b90a52848ca78c793bd66bfd4707935e54e04f375bb426771b248", "ja": "（今日はついに本番当日。\nウィルゴのみんなの様子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（今天就是表演的日子了，\n不晓得『处女座』的成员们状态如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9b59b7f63653af9592e2b91b0ddabb344970bd48140ca65a1dd2332eb28dce5d", "ja": "あれから私、ちょっと考えて……すこしだけ、\nわかった気がするんです。要は、その……。", "zh": "后来我花了一点时间思考……\n我觉得我好像有点明白了。重点就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "f1c492f68eda9ed6acafc24894cc727ce15242cf4bb617c3f4b364e54e5057a2", "ja": "こ、恋のこと。温かくて、優しくて……\nうれしい気持ち。それが、恋なんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "爱、爱情是很温暖、柔和的东西……\n是一种高兴的心情，我猜这就是所谓的爱情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "72b7591a3a767b50aa5faf9037c83708e2e89ec41059633656066229c9513bd3", "ja": "オレも、ちょっとわかったかも。なんか、\n胸のとこがあったかくって、キュンってなるよな？", "zh": "我好像也有点懂了。\n感觉心里有个地方暖呼呼的，会揪一下对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "b68dbebe35343b2c649d9e2fe8beba1bd14ef7f5e6820f4319538244f7a87cb7", "ja": "そう……不思議な感じです。まるで、\nモノクロの世界に、色がついたみたいな……。", "zh": "对啊……感觉真是奇妙，\n就好像黑白的世界突然有了色彩一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "4beb85b8a18c2197f12894f4f94e3d70e96b735ae1f4a2d104c3d9ac5d010aa9", "ja": "おお……！　それ、すっげー恋って感じがするよ！\nさすが、百合子だな♪", "zh": "喔喔……！这个比喻超有爱情的氛围！\n真不愧是百合子耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "39543de3fe36321ef93137002b0ee397d7c42dba2f7ebca3abf587f26b9a43ff", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n百合子は言葉の表し方が上手だ。", "zh": "嗯，说得对。\n百合子真会用言语表达。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "80b515f0788c817da66c8a60b0c0ba1d05c61fd6666319b474717cccb5e46174", "ja": "で、でも、あのデートはあくまで疑似体験ですし！\n……本気にしたりするのは、ダメですから。", "zh": "可、可是，那场约会终究是模拟体验！\n……大家千万不可以当真喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "715e88cd3ca747c3ca86312415e913a54aa7ac9995fd767d600de04eedb38a46", "ja": "う、うん。そうだよね。\n……なんだかちょっと、切ないなぁ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，说得也是。\n……不晓得为什么，感觉有点惆怅呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "25e96a6abedd95f9a8ff676370db5040ec7aaf1f6fd44087bf29646f80a6343f", "ja": "本当の恋には、まだ距離があるんだと思う。でも、\nそれでいいの。だって私たちは、アイドルなんだもの。", "zh": "我想我们离真正的爱情还有些距离，\n但这样也好，因为我们是偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a933bc4902e2a5e07c983c35971bb7975f559e238f44fbc8ac3f2d3b9a14f90", "ja": "そーそー。けっこー楽しかったけど、\nオレ達の目標は、公演を成功させることだもんな！", "zh": "没错没错，虽然玩得很开心，\n但我们的目标毕竟是让公演成功嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "be16fad3281b5353153a0b68b5b7b3931ed57c421205976dc2cc276df9976a9e", "ja": "そ、そうですよね！　……はぁ。\nいつか私たちも、本物の恋をする日が来るのかな……？", "zh": "也、也是呢！\n……唉，我们真的会有坠入爱河的那一天吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "db4628514e2d30b7cdf9b0c8190ab6778161be7216125a0b172ac2a9453cee26", "ja": "えっ！？　や、ちょっとハズい……。\nでも……そういう日も、来るのかも。生きてたら。", "zh": "咦！？讨厌，真难为情……\n不过……我想有生之年，一定会有那么一天的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "7d14fea23551076a5627bf6f75eb2e6fea93d4e50ed2aa1c14395103c635c03e", "ja": "ま、まだ先のことだから！　とにかく、今は\n今日の公演を成功させることを考えないと！", "zh": "这、这还久得很啦！总之，我们现在\n得专心让今天的公演成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "271cbdaf5c53ba748d62fc172dfcd94abd44ebc67a4e308f9d4c79a93b6e1dda", "ja": "みんな、話はその辺にして……そろそろ本番だ。\n行けるか？", "zh": "各位，闲聊就到这边……差不多要上台了，\n准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "e9b6bd35739d341f957e55619d02d740adbe97bb3caeddd040d1defe9ac49836", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\nもちろんですっ！", "zh": "嗯，{$P$}，\n这是当然的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "6cae4c6f87aaad5063425477a63d23913041fe8c8fccd8c1ad390428295e08a9", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、恋について一緒に\n考えてくれたから……私たち、この歌を歌えます！", "zh": "因为有{$P$}先生陪我们一起摸索\n爱情这个课题……我们才能好好诠释这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "dbb8338fb04f5279ca33d2d98b74aaed744df2b8f236628758c68e9e8a6194f8", "ja": "うん、そうだよな！\n今のオレ達なら、バッチリだぜ！", "zh": "嗯，说得对！\n现在的我们肯定没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dadd98a9f1a01b6cc6757ad2567d936481d14ea755b4c8fa7a31d6c71e35c397", "ja": "うん、頼もしいな。\n……よし、みんな行ってこい！", "zh": "嗯，真是可靠。\n……好，大家快上场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "e7372180b8eb8e01acac844254c97a295d43bbbe99efd0f39297172226ec770c", "ja": "おうっ！（はいっ！）", "zh": "好！（好的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b72f2ecdd90919dc1580850b9568ca6aeb8a4800af78c907302946e0c7e7a42d", "ja": "（恋について、たくさん気持ちを傾けて、考えた。その\n歌声は、会場のお客さん達にもきっと届くはずだ！）", "zh": "（她们对爱情做了那么多想像与摸索，\n我相信她们的歌声肯定可以打动来场的观众们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1024_audience", "source_sha256": "83fcb9b6529872bb9b6dda8914e325982422e87c11f7864324817bbcca600ffd", "ja": "ワァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e2d305e7cc5e8e6554d61ca3ee068df6855024266094a7aecd16f9b6c5fca604", "ja": "（大きな歓声が、劇場いっぱいに響いている。\nこれは、改めて聞くまでもないな……）", "zh": "（热烈的欢呼声响彻剧场。\n看来不用开口问也知道观众的反应了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "44073f4603c8c9d6458d670c8886aadc0b2129122c6653e226656fd52019c693", "ja": "{$P$}！　なあなあ、どうだった！？\nオレ達、ちゃんと歌えてた！？", "zh": "{$P$}！欸欸，你觉得怎么样！？\n我们诠释得如何！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8550ce6f3e15432e2fc2e4415260880fec05a6e8bbea2b4e4ef264cf32adb783", "ja": "お疲れさま、昴。うん、いいステージだった。\n今までで一番、恋の切なさが出せてたと思うよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，昴。嗯，我觉得表演非常精彩，\n是你们将爱情的伤悲表达得最好的一次喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "36630a984fcab4cd705364e819c74820609b6f1157a5851e1822ac1f9d795a47", "ja": "ホント！？　いろいろハズいコトもあったけど、\nがんばってよかったな～。", "zh": "真的吗！？虽然有很多害羞的部分，\n但还好我有努力唱出来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "1d6140b5cdc1fd217edc6d56ed9ac1d3ca02117f5194772d80525405b5b62086", "ja": "これが、恋の力なんですね……！\nなんてロマンチックなんでしょう……。", "zh": "这就是，爱情的力量吧……！\n真是太浪漫了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "6089ffc801fbcbc459d9d78aa32f794cde72ef5b3eee9117aa77a99f3b7d075a", "ja": "みんな、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "大家、{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "eac9382d37bb00079cae70bdf7334c4be6cef46828398591ca48d3fa4a49cafb", "ja": "音無さん、お疲れさまです！\n今日は前説、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "音无小姐，辛苦了！\n今天谢谢你帮忙开场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "1f6ca77e58f360743afdeee9405bfc339c48211dcdf75a78997e38eafa1f88db", "ja": "ふふっ、どういたしまして！　美咲ちゃんも\n忙しいし……私だって、手伝える時は手伝いますよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，不用客气！毕竟美咲在忙……\n我能帮忙的时候当然要尽量帮呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "afb8083794b464f14822b53c3aeddb80d3b87b32e6d89caa163627eb24cd6016", "ja": "小鳥の前説、すっげー盛り上がってたな！\n初恋の話、ビックリしたけど、面白かったぜ！", "zh": "小鸟的开场把气氛炒得超级热烈呢！\n那个初恋的故事，虽然让人吓了一跳，但真的很有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b1fd79401cf8158e8fde311709544793dbc957aaf9f59e95d7ef786a0a916fe2", "ja": "音無さんの、高校生の頃のはかない恋の思い出……\n俺も聞いていて、キュンとしました。", "zh": "音无小姐在高中时代的短暂爱情回忆……\n也让我听得好感动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "6147d9bf6bc2deff7b9d2fe8499feffe9c42624bf8fc7b44c53533ca14241518", "ja": "やだ、{$P$}さんまで！\nもうっ、忘れてくださいー！", "zh": "讨厌，连{$P$}先生都这样！\n唉唷，快点忘掉啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "80d105641a4a7d7d2e1e887c06f0311d65936d7a910b074a24961debc6c484da", "ja": "そんな！　私、もっとあの話聞きたいです。\n教えてくれませんか？", "zh": "怎么这么说！我还想再听你讲下去，\n可以告诉我后续进展吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "31f1b3dee3668817b2dee0a519c0ee9ab12d691acbabb4d441cf0fbc2460bf0a", "ja": "私も知りたいですっ！　あの、結局\nその男の子とはどうなったんですかっ！？", "zh": "我也很好奇！那个，\n你跟那个男生最后到底怎样了呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "88e04f17522bcbb1d25673b61791f2638672ded0e7240821a3d26888e3f80ceb", "ja": "どうもこうも、何もないのよ。ただ突然、\n告白されてびっくりしたってだけで……。", "zh": "也没怎样，后续没有任何进展，就只是他\n突然跟我告白，吓了我一跳而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1039_101kot", "source_sha256": "f882f847618652f9e902623a612e531ddf9810c539f69dcf5075d9cae5c5972e", "ja": "それからすぐに、高木社長に会って……。\nふふっ、懐かしいなあ。", "zh": "之后过没多久，我就遇到高木社长了……\n呵呵，真是怀念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1040_101kot", "source_sha256": "aed1280d1c4eaa315441c85a0a2156dd9ae6d7c776f6b1f1bc87edd26f48e992", "ja": "だから、本当に何もないの。でも、\n思い出って、すごく素敵なものだと思うわ。", "zh": "所以，这段故事真的没有任何进展。\n不过，我觉得这段回忆非常美好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "226e7d1d8ac513e7192f259aaf3cef8da7a568805ca4cb0e51729deb5cba5f5b", "ja": "思い出……。", "zh": "回忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "d94349b70296627d5e76fce28acf31da2556d63c84dfdaf5c29e82eee7499d59", "ja": "いつか今日のことも、私たちにとって、\n思い出になるのかな……。", "zh": "今天发生的种种，在将来也会变成\n我们心中的回忆吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1043_101kot", "source_sha256": "5b7a269e5ea2ff28630f79a4f4f1dc26b4a832d2f908835d20d577070d7d53b2", "ja": "うん。そう思うわ。だからみんなは、\n一日一日を大切に……楽しみましょうね！", "zh": "嗯，我想是的。\n所以，你们要珍惜当下的每一天……好好享受人生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1044_p", "source_sha256": "c2c8ca3df560032c31b903e0260f1aba95937a91bfb32a959bab39904cf790df", "ja": "（ウィルゴの3人が恋を知ろうとしたのは、何よりも\nアイドルとして最高のステージを作り上げるため……）", "zh": "（『处女座』的三位成员之所以想去理解爱情，\n不为别的，就是为了呈现出偶像最棒的表演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_06_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a73ce0c0bfb458a6ef9aa92fbe3ee932e960f29e80c39e9b52f0e42c606d7fac", "ja": "（……もしかしたら今の3人は、\nステージに恋をしているのかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（……或许她们三个，\n现在坠入爱河的对象就是这个舞台呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
